title: Leuna
subtitle: The police bring up artillery against the chemical works.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: crisis_march = 1 and crisis_time = 2
max-visits: 1
priority: 10
on-arrival: {!
// what the works guard has to fight with
var arms = Q.red_guards_arms + 3 * (Q.district_halle_guards || 0) + (Q.e21_ma_hoelz == 1 ? 10 : 0);
var p = 0.1 + arms / 120 + (Q.e21_ma_out >= 200 ? 0.1 : 0) - 0.04 * Q.e21_ma_rift;
Q.e21_leuna_p = Math.max(0.1, Math.min(0.75, p));
Q.e21_leuna_odds = (Q.e21_leuna_p < 0.3) ? 1 : ((Q.e21_leuna_p < 0.5) ? 2 : 3);
// the district that will refuse to come out, if the Zentrale called the Reich out
var c = Q.districts.filter(function (d) {
    return d != 'halle' && !Q['district_' + d + '_strike'] && Q['district_' + d + '_members'] >= 3;
});
c.sort(function (a, b) { return Q['district_' + a + '_militancy'] - Q['district_' + b + '_militancy']; });
Q.e21_refuse_district = c.length ? c[0] : 0;
Q.crisis_line_1 = 'Out on strike: about ' + Math.round(Q.e21_ma_out / 10) * 10 + ',000 of the ' + Q.e21_ma_need + ',000 it takes';
Q.crisis_line_2 = ['Leuna: occupied by its workers', 'Leuna: held against the police', 'Leuna: stormed on 29 March', 'Leuna: given up without a fight'][Q.e21_leuna];
Q.crisis_line_3 = (Q.e21_ma_rift >= 5) ? 'At the gates: the other workers have turned on us' : ((Q.e21_ma_rift >= 3) ? 'At the gates: worker against worker' : (Q.e21_ma_rift ? 'At the gates: some fights with the men at work' : 'At the gates: no fights yet'));
!}

= Leuna

The Leuna works near Merseburg, the biggest chemical plant in Europe, have been in the workers' hands since the strike began. Thousands live inside the walls. They have rifles, a few machine guns and an armoured train they built in the works' own shops.

The Security Police have brought up artillery and given the occupiers until dawn. [? if e21_leuna_odds = 1 : The man who commands the works guard, a sergeant in the war, does not think they can hold for a day. ?][? if e21_leuna_odds = 2 : The commander of the works guard thinks it could go either way. ?][? if e21_leuna_odds = 3 : The commander of the works guard thinks they can hold, if the walls do. ?]

- @hold: Hold the works.
- @relieve: Send the Halle fighting groups to break the ring.
- @withdraw: Negotiate a way out.

@hold
subtitle: If Leuna holds, the strike holds. If it falls, it falls hard.
on-arrival: {!
if (Math.random() < Q.e21_leuna_p) {
    Q.e21_leuna = 1;
    Q.e21_ma_out += 50;
    RG.ledger('The workers of Leuna held their works against the Security Police.', 'e21_leuna_held');
} else {
    Q.e21_leuna = 2;
    Q.e21_ma_out = Math.max(20, Q.e21_ma_out - 60);
    RG.district('halle', {members: -0.08, guards: -2, repression: 12});
    RG.news('Leuna stormed: more than a thousand prisoners marched away', 3);
}
Q.lean_offensive += 2;
Q.crisis_line_1 = 'Out on strike: about ' + Math.round(Q.e21_ma_out / 10) * 10 + ',000 of the ' + Q.e21_ma_need + ',000 it takes';
Q.crisis_line_2 = ['Leuna: occupied by its workers', 'Leuna: held against the police', 'Leuna: stormed on 29 March', 'Leuna: given up without a fight'][Q.e21_leuna];
Q.crisis_line_3 = (Q.e21_ma_rift >= 5) ? 'At the gates: the other workers have turned on us' : ((Q.e21_ma_rift >= 3) ? 'At the gates: worker against worker' : (Q.e21_ma_rift ? 'At the gates: some fights with the men at work' : 'At the gates: no fights yet'));
!}

[? if e21_leuna = 1 : The guns open up at dawn and the works do not fall. By evening the police have pulled back to the Merseburg road. ?][? if e21_leuna = 2 : On 29 March the police shell the works and storm them. Those who surrender are beaten in the yard, and some are shot. More than a thousand men are marched away. ?]

@relieve
subtitle: [? if lock_uprising = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Better odds if Halle has fighting groups to send. If the column is caught, we lose both.
choose-if: lock_uprising < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids armed action.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_uprising == 1) {
    Q.unity -= 10;
    Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10;
}
var p = Q.e21_leuna_p + ((Q.district_halle_guards || 0) >= 5 ? 0.15 : -0.1);
if (Math.random() < p) {
    Q.e21_leuna = 1;
    Q.e21_ma_out += 70;
    RG.district('halle', {militancy: 6});
    RG.ledger('Armed workers from Halle broke the police ring around Leuna.', 'e21_leuna_held');
} else {
    Q.e21_leuna = 2;
    Q.e21_ma_out = Math.max(20, Q.e21_ma_out - 70);
    RG.district('halle', {guards: -3, repression: 12, members: -0.06});
    RG.news('Relief column cut down on the Merseburg road; Leuna falls', 3);
}
Q.lean_offensive += 2;
Q.crisis_line_1 = 'Out on strike: about ' + Math.round(Q.e21_ma_out / 10) * 10 + ',000 of the ' + Q.e21_ma_need + ',000 it takes';
Q.crisis_line_2 = ['Leuna: occupied by its workers', 'Leuna: held against the police', 'Leuna: stormed on 29 March', 'Leuna: given up without a fight'][Q.e21_leuna];
Q.crisis_line_3 = (Q.e21_ma_rift >= 5) ? 'At the gates: the other workers have turned on us' : ((Q.e21_ma_rift >= 3) ? 'At the gates: worker against worker' : (Q.e21_ma_rift ? 'At the gates: some fights with the men at work' : 'At the gates: no fights yet'));
!}

[? if e21_leuna = 1 : Columns of armed workers from Halle and Ammendorf fall on the police lines from behind, and the ring breaks. ?][? if e21_leuna = 2 : The relief column is caught on the open road by machine guns. The survivors scatter, and the works fall on 29 March. ?]

@withdraw
subtitle: We lose the works and keep the men. The strike will feel it.
on-arrival: {!
Q.e21_leuna = 3;
Q.e21_ma_out = Math.max(20, Q.e21_ma_out - 10);
RG.district('halle', {loyalty: -3});
Q.lean_unionist += 1;
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 1;
Q.crisis_line_1 = 'Out on strike: about ' + Math.round(Q.e21_ma_out / 10) * 10 + ',000 of the ' + Q.e21_ma_need + ',000 it takes';
Q.crisis_line_2 = ['Leuna: occupied by its workers', 'Leuna: held against the police', 'Leuna: stormed on 29 March', 'Leuna: given up without a fight'][Q.e21_leuna];
Q.crisis_line_3 = (Q.e21_ma_rift >= 5) ? 'At the gates: the other workers have turned on us' : ((Q.e21_ma_rift >= 3) ? 'At the gates: worker against worker' : (Q.e21_ma_rift ? 'At the gates: some fights with the men at work' : 'At the gates: no fights yet'));
!}

Through a works council member with a brother in the police, the occupiers agree to march out in the night with their rifles hidden under their coats. In the morning the police take an empty factory.
